'''Minicyclone''' (ミニサロン, ''Mini Saron'', '''Mini Salon''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

==Combo==
