}}

==Trivia==
*Minicyclone appears to be a mistranslation. Its Japanese name (ミニサロン) is "Minisalon" written in katakana (likely referring to how [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Solar Cat]] could have the effect of a "mini tanning salon"), but may have been mistaken for ミニサイクロン ("Minicyclone").

